#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House3/scripts.inc:22
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House3_Text_JuanHasManyFansDoYou"
msgid ""
"You're a POKéMON TRAINER, aren't you?\p"
"SOOTOPOLIS's JUAN has many fans.\n"
"Even more than his student WALLACE!\p"
"Do you have any?$"
msgstr ""
"你是宝可梦训练家吧？\p"
"琉璃市的亚当有很多粉丝，\n"
"比他的徒弟米可利还多！\p"
"你有粉丝吗？$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House3/scripts.inc:28
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House3_Text_YouMustBePrettyStrong"
msgid "Oh, then you must be pretty strong.$"
msgstr "哦，那你一定很强吧。$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House3/scripts.inc:31
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House3_Text_LonesomeTryWorkingHarder"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear…\n"
"That's a little lonesome.\p"
"Try working a little harder to get\n"
"a fan following.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀……\n"
"那有点寂寞呢。\p"
"再努力一点，\n"
"争取拥有一些粉丝吧。$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House3/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House3_Text_TrainerFanClubWasWild"
msgid ""
"Dedicated fans come over from even\n"
"outside of HOENN.\p"
"It was really wild when I went to the\n"
"TRAINER FAN CLUB in LILYCOVE.$"
msgstr ""
"还有忠实的粉丝\n"
"从丰缘地区以外的地方赶来。\p"
"我去水静市的训练家粉丝俱乐部时，\n"
"那里真是热闹极了。$"
